OL,4,CMan arrested after woman, 22, raped in 
OL,5,CGlasgow park                           
OL,6,GA man has been arrested after a woman  
OL,7,Gwas raped in a Glasgow park, police    
OL,8,Ghave said.                             
OL,10,FThe 37-year-old was arrested in        
OL,11,Fconnection with the serious sexual     
OL,12,Fassault of a 22-year-old woman at      
OL,13,Fabout 23:50 on Friday near to the      
OL,14,Fbridge from Kelvin Walkway.            
OL,16,FThe woman had been walking through the 
OL,17,Fpark when the incident took place and  
OL,18,Fan appeal was later released by police.
OL,20,FFollowing the arrest, Police Scotland  
OL,21,Fsaid inquiries remained ongoing.       
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
