OL,4,CArts charity worker unfairly dismissed 
OL,5,Cwhile facing cancer                    
OL,6,GAn arts charity unfairly dismissed a   
OL,7,Gmember of staff who was undergoing     
OL,8,Ginvestigations for brain cancer, an    
OL,9,Gemployment tribunal has ruled.         
OL,11,FBryan Peterson, who had worked for     
OL,12,FShetland Arts Development Agency       
OL,13,F(Sada) for 17 years, was going through 
OL,14,Fa redundancy process when an MRI scan  
OL,15,Findicated he likely had a life-        
OL,16,Flimiting tumour.                       
OL,18,FPeterson asked for his redundancy to   
OL,19,Fbe paused to allow for retirement due  
OL,20,Fto ill-health be explored instead, but 
OL,21,Fthe charity refused the request.       
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
