OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CUnison members vote to reject          
OL,5,Ccouncil's new pay structure            
OL,6,GMembers of the union Unison have voted 
OL,7,Gto reject a controversial new pay      
OL,8,Gstructure proposed by Glasgow City     
OL,9,GCouncil.                               
OL,11,FThe trade union, which is the largest  
OL,12,Frepresenting workers at the local      
OL,13,Fauthority, said members want more      
OL,14,Fmoney for lower-paid staff when the    
OL,15,Fpay structure is overhauled.           
OL,17,FThe council says it must bring in a    
OL,18,Fnew pay and grading structure to deal  
OL,19,Fwith underlying issues which led to    
OL,20,Fthousands of equal pay claims from     
OL,21,Ffemale workers past and present.       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
